>  Are you saying that being Lawful protects one from Titans?  I've never
>  been so fortunate.

The following monsters all have a good chance of being peaceful for
lawful characters:

Titans - useful if you get that version of the Medusa level
Archons - useful on the Ascension run, as you're unlikely to see them
  before leaving Gehennom for the final time
Golden Nagas - another potentially dangerous spellcasting monster
Asmodeus and Baalzebub - handy if you need to get past them quickly
tengus (incredibly annoying, that)

There are others, but these are the ones that are likely to affect your
game.

